      "id": "concept_7",
      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "With three statements, test the smallest useful combination.\n\nSometimes one statement plus either of two equivalent statements is enough.\n\nThe aim is to identify which information is necessary, not to use every fact automatically.",
